module jev_calibration_plan_outcome_window_observation_lsp

input status
input target_stage
input chain_digest
input reason

status INFORMATION for BOUND plan-outcome provenance
status HINT for DEFERRED plan-outcome provenance
status ERROR for UNKNOWN or missing chain evidence

field code
field severity

constraint inspection_only
constraint provenance_projection
constraint read_only
constraint no_edits
constraint no_command
constraint no_execution
constraint no_authorization
